# Project Architecture

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 16 (App Router) + React 19
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Shadcn UI + Radix UI
- Three.js / @react-three/fiber for 3D book preview

## Key Directories
- `web/src/app/` - App Router pages and API routes
- `web/src/components/` - UI components (use Shadcn patterns)
- `web/src/lib/` - API clients, utilities
- `web/infra/` - Terraform for GCP infrastructure

## API Routes
- `/api/storybook/generate` - Creates storybook job
- `/api/storybook/jobs/[jobId]` - Job status
- `/api/contact` - Contact form (SMTP)

## Component Patterns
- Use functional components with hooks
- Shadcn UI for base components (in ui/)
- Stylus modules (.module.styl) for complex styles
- Tailwind for utility classes

## State Management
- React Query for server state
- Zustand for global client state
- URL params via nuqs for shareable state
